    "principalName": "Dr. S. K. Mukherjee",
    "principalMessage": "At Bright Horizon School, education goes beyond textbooks. We believe in nurturing curious minds, fostering moral integrity, and empowering every child to excel in an ever-evolving world. Our holistic curriculum blends academic rigor with arts, sports, technology, and community values.",
