    "schoolHistory": "Established in 1998, Bright Horizon School began with a vision to provide world-class education with affordable accessibility. Over 28 years, our campus has expanded to accommodate modern science labs, smart classrooms, sports complexes, and a vibrant community of over 2,000 learners.",
